      ],
      "source": "https://www.islands.com/2023273/ellington-missouri-ozark-mountains-city-scenic-downtown-blue-spring/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The historic Klepzig Mill near Ellington showcases old‑school Ozark industrial technology and is a must‑see for history buffs.",
